# Roster strings. Keys are relative to Mods.Levy.Roster (prefix comes from the file name).
Nothing: nothing
KillerFall: the fall
KillerLava: lava
KillerDrowning: the water
KillerUnknown: misadventure
Fell: "{0} fell."
Memorial: "{0} will not return. The name goes on the memorial."
Discharged: "{0} has been discharged."
ReturnsToDuty: "{0} returns to duty."
Rebased: "{0} now reports to {1}."
Homeless: "{0} has no barracks and will follow you."
NoHome: That soldier has no barracks to pay from.
RallyCooldown: The horn needs {0} more seconds.
TaxCollected: The Tax Collector paid {0} into the treasury of {1}.
CrystalRefused: "{0} cannot use that. It was handed back."
Demoted: "{0} has been demoted to {1}."
DemoteBlocked: "{0} cannot be demoted yet. The spare accessories have nowhere to go."
Demobilized: "{0} goes to the reserve."
Remobilized: "{0} returns to active duty."
InReserve: "{0} is in reserve. Recall them first."
ReserveFull: The reserve is full ({0} soldiers).
ReserveMutinous: "{0} is in mutiny and refuses the order."
